{
  "page": 367,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2933,
      "text": "Ṭā Sīn Mīm.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2934,
      "text": "Inilah ayat-ayat Kitab (Al-Qur`an) yang jelas.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2935,
      "text": "Boleh jadi engkau (Muhammad) akan membinasakan dirimu (dengan kesedihan), karena mereka (penduduk Mekkah) tidak beriman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2936,
      "text": "Jika Kami menghendaki, niscaya Kami turunkan kepada mereka mukjizat dari langit, yang akan membuat tengkuk mereka tunduk dengan rendah hati kepadanya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2937,
      "text": "Dan setiap kali disampaikan kepada mereka suatu peringatan baru (ayat Al-Qur`an yang diturunkan) dari Tuhan Yang Maha Pengasih, mereka selalu berpaling darinya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2938,
      "text": "Sungguh, mereka telah mendustakan (Al-Qur`an), maka kelak akan datang kepada mereka (kebenaran) berita-berita mengenai apa (azab) yang dulu mereka perolok-olokkan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2939,
      "text": "Dan apakah mereka tidak memperhatikan bumi, betapa banyak Kami tumbuhkan di bumi itu berbagai macam (tumbuh-tumbuhan) yang baik?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2940,
      "text": "Sungguh, pada yang demikian itu terdapat tanda (kebesaran Allah), tetapi kebanyakan mereka tidak beriman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2941,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, Tuhanmu Dialah Yang Mahaperkasa, Maha Penyayang.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2942,
      "text": "Dan (ingatlah) ketika Tuhanmu menyeru Musa (dengan firman-Nya), \"Datangilah kaum yang zalim itu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2943,
      "text": "(yaitu) kaum Fir'aun. Mengapa mereka tidak bertakwa?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2944,
      "text": "Dia (Musa) berkata, \"Ya Tuhanku, sungguh, aku takut mereka akan mendustakan aku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2945,
      "text": "sehingga dadaku terasa sempit dan lidahku tidak lancar maka utuslah Harun582) (bersamaku).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2946,
      "text": "Sebab aku berdosa terhadap mereka,583) maka aku takut mereka akan membunuhku.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2947,
      "text": "(Allah) berfirman, \"Jangan takut (mereka tidak akan dapat membunuhmu)! Maka pergilah kamu berdua dengan membawa ayat-ayat Kami (mukjizat-mukjizat); sungguh, Kami bersamamu mendengarkan (apa yang mereka katakan).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2948,
      "text": "Maka datanglah kamu berdua kepada Fir'aun dan katakan, \"Sesungguhnya kami adalah rasul-rasul Tuhan seluruh alam,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2949,
      "text": "lepaskanlah Bani Israil (pergi) bersama kami.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2950,
      "text": "Dia (Fir'aun) menjawab, \"Bukankah kami telah mengasuhmu dalam lingkungan (keluarga) kami, waktu engkau masih kanak-kanak dan engkau tinggal bersama kami beberapa tahun dari umurmu.584)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2951,
      "text": "Dan engkau (Musa) telah melakukan (kesalahan dari) perbuatan yang telah engkau lakukan585) dan engkau termasuk orang yang tidak tahu berterima kasih.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
